{
  "id": "poem-ec43d8d7c0ac9f2366ac9229",
  "title": "乌夜啼",
  "author": "无名氏《张协状元》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "听得你鸡鸣起。",
    "(旦出接)扑簌簌泪两下。",
    "(末)你郎今挂绿在京华。",
    "(旦)音书断，没成虚假。",
    "(合)不免辞庙去，京里试寻它。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-2645",
